sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario/UI
    participant API as API local
    participant CM as Capability Manager
    participant WF as Workflow Engine
    participant INV as Read Inventory Action
    participant ANA as Analyze Action
    participant KG as Graph Action
    participant EB as Event Bus

    U->>API: POST storage.disk-analysis<br/>{scope: all_detected}
    API->>API: Validar esquema cerrado
    API->>CM: execute(capability_id, input)
    CM->>WF: workflow server-owned
    WF->>EB: workflow.started / capability.started
    WF->>INV: leer inventario público fijo
    INV-->>WF: dispositivos normalizados
    WF->>EB: postcheck + action.completed
    WF->>ANA: analizar evidencia estructurada
    ANA-->>WF: summary + findings
    WF->>KG: proyectar discos y particiones
    KG->>EB: knowledge.graph.updated
    KG-->>WF: revisión del grafo
    WF->>EB: workflow.completed / capability.completed
    WF-->>CM: ejecución auditable
    CM-->>API: resultado sin Actions privadas
    API-->>U: resumen, hallazgos y métricas
